# Coding Standards (NENE2 inheritance)

- **SSOT:** `docs/inheritance-from-nene2.md`, `docs/development/coding-standards.md`, ADR 0008.
- **Backend:** domain-grouped `src/{Domain}/` — Handler → UseCase → Repository; `SuiteAuditRecorder` in mutating use cases; control DB only.
- **Frontend:** `app → pages → features → entities → shared`; TanStack Query in entities; no fetch outside `shared/api/client.ts`.
- **Naming:** `docs/development/naming-conventions.md` + `docs/explanation/terminology.md` — violations block merge.
- **Schema:** `catalog/` and `schema/` per `docs/development/schema-conventions.md`.
- **i18n:** UI strings in `frontend/src/shared/i18n/messages/` per `docs/development/i18n.md`.
- **PR:** run checklists from `docs/development/self-review.md`; name them in PR body.
- **Do not** copy NENE2 framework trees into `src/`; **do not** add sibling domain logic.
